// Index 3 of the kept winning labeled hammings not equal to the lower central value.
// Fewer than four outside values returns -1, not 0. An index-3 value of 0 stays 0.
// Ordinary program: no HOLD_FLASH line.

CUBE lnfl ROLE observer PROTON 1
CUBE rank ROLE nanobot  PROTON 1

PLUG lnfl rank

IMPULSE lnfl 1
IMPULSE rank 1
ENERGYFLOW 1
FLOW 1
HARMONY rank
DECIDE rank
ASSERT CUBES >= 2
PRINT "lnfl" UNITY DECIDE ENERGY
